# 047 — Viewer `view` and file manager `fm`, read-only (tools T1) — superseded

**Type:** tool · **Owner:** tools track · **Priority:** P2 · **Status:** superseded (2026-10-04) · **Roadmap:** track G, T1 · **Blocked by:** 042, 043

## Problem

There is no way to browse or read files except `files` and `list`.

## Plan

- `view`: text and hex view with scrolling and search. `fm`: two panels, navigation, view.

## Acceptance criteria

- QEMU suites `view`, `fm` (screendump checks).

